      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="503" resized="true" width="368" x="11" y="21">Prepare Optimizer Constraints&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This block retrieves constraints from the constraints table and combines them with dynamically generated derived equations. These are aggregated to form a unified and complete constraint set. The final constraint set is then passed to the Gekko optimizer to enforce all model rules and limitations during optimization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: constraints&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: derived equations&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: model_tag&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1. Constraints&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
